      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On that note, it would be very cool if the boop button were disabled on people with boops off, kind of like cloning is disabled on people with cloning off. \n\nRight now there's no indication whether a boop is received or not, I foresee this being problematic with particularly needy or fragile friendships who take a lack of response, reciprocal boop, or some other kind of acknowledgement personally.",
